 app.innerHTML=header('Choose the help you need.','Free, choice-based guidance for individuals. No account or payment is required.','FREE GUIDANCE')+`<div class="app-bg"><div class="wrap workspace"><section id="journeys" class="free-guidance-hub"><a class="start-choice" href="#woman"><span aria-hidden="true">01</span><div><strong>I have a workplace concern</strong><small>Understand options, reporting routes and complaint preparation.</small></div><span class="start-arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span></a><a class="start-choice" href="#respondent"><span aria-hidden="true">02</span><div><strong>I received a complaint</strong><small>Understand notices, fair process and preparing a factual reply.</small></div><span class="start-arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span></a><p>No names, witness identities or confidential case narratives are requested. Editable drafts must be reviewed and completed before submission; this website does not file complaints.</p><a class="btn btn-light" href="#demo">Explore the free inquiry stages →</a></section></div></div>`;
